@startuml
title Activity Diagram: Monitoring IoT (User Fisik & Admin Web)

' --- SWIMLANES (AREA KERJA) ---
|User (Fisik)|
|Hardware (ESP32)|
|Firebase / Database|
|Admin (Web)|

' --- BAGIAN 1: ADMIN LOGIN (PERSIAPAN) ---
|Admin (Web)|
start
:Buka Halaman Web Admin;
:Input Email & Password;

if (Password Benar?) then (Tidak)
    :Tampilkan Pesan "Email atau Password salah";
    detach
else (Ya)
    :Masuk ke Dashboard;
    :Request Data Status Awal;
endif

|Firebase / Database|
:Kirim Status Terakhir;

|Admin (Web)|
:Tampilkan Dashboard (Standby);
note right
  Admin sekarang dalam 
  mode "Monitoring"
end note

' --- BAGIAN 2: USER BERAKSI (REMOTE) ---
|User (Fisik)|
:Arahkan ke objek;

|Hardware (ESP32)|
:Sensor Menerima Sinyal IR;
:Decode Kode Hex;
:Set Status (ON/OFF);
:Kirim Data ke Firebase;


' --- BAGIAN 3: SINKRONISASI (REALTIME) ---
|Firebase / Database|
:Update Status di Database;
:Broadcast Perubahan ke Admin;

|Admin (Web)|
:Menerima Data Baru (Realtime);
:Update Tampilan Status Lampu;
:Update Tabel Riwayat (Log);

stop
@enduml